34
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:51,346
¿Y qué hay ahí, tan interesante?

35
00:06:54,724 --> 00:06:55,726
Levántate.

36
00:06:59,186 --> 00:07:03,108
Has sido un buen chico.
Recuérdalo, O'Malley.

37
00:07:04,025 --> 00:07:05,945
Los chicos buenos no hablan.

38
00:07:32,511 --> 00:07:35,100
- Hola, Con.
- Hola, mamá.

39
00:07:39,019 --> 00:07:41,523
